ad, plan modular architecture from pre-production: one core narrative, then optimize 3–4 distinct cuts (15s, 60s, 2–3 min) natively for each platform.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where should a brand film run?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Match length to platform: 15–30s on TikTok, Instagram, LinkedIn ads; 60s on YouTube pre-roll and Facebook; 90–120s as YouTube organic; 2–5 minutes on your website, email, and landing pages. Always include a clear call-to-action directing viewers to the next step.\"}}]}]}"}></script>
